CM 40/20 m trap dipole using 4nec2's LC-trap load (LD 6, coil Q 150)
CM in insulated wire (LD 7, PVC over #14).
CE
SY inner=5.0, trap=0.1, outer=3.7, h=12
GW 1 13 0 -inner-trap-outer h 0 -inner-trap h #14
GW 2 1 0 -inner-trap h 0 -inner h #14
GW 3 21 0 -inner h 0 inner h #14
GW 4 1 0 inner h 0 inner+trap h #14
GW 5 13 0 inner+trap h 0 inner+trap+outer h #14
GE 0
LD 6 2 1 1 150 4.7uH 52pF
LD 6 4 1 1 150 4.7uH 52pF 14.2
LD 7 0 0 0 3.2 1.5mm
EX 0 3 11 0 1 0
FR 0 2 0 0 7.1 7.1
EN
